When you kill a foe with a melee strike you quickly throw some of their remains in your steam engine, instantly regenerating [3, 6, 8, 10, 12 (TL1-5)] steam.

When you deal a critical melee strike you also have a [6%, 15%, 21%, 25%, 28% (TL1-5)] chance to cut a part of your foe and use it in your steam engine.

When either of those happens this strikes fear in all foes in radius 4 of the victim, brainlocking them for [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns.

''To the meat grinder!''
